{"repo_path": "platform/frameworks/base", "commit_hash": "0f857518e3dd6490508a88ceac39309e77cb231b", "author_name": "John Wu", "author_email": "topjohnwu@google.com", "commit_time": "Thu Jul 21 22:29:01 2022 +0000", "commit_message": "Update ActivityIntentHelper to use PendingIntents directly\n\nUse PendingIntent.queryIntentComponents to query components instead of\ngoing through the intent contained. This allows package manager to\nproperly determine the identity to perform the intent resolution.\n\nBug: 238415222\nBug: 271845008\nTest: manual\n(cherry picked from https://googleplex-android-review.googlesource.com/q/commit:3ee3b7a20a109063cdc2233a1429f78ad8c5ab79)\nMerged-In: I0dd32765755732a7a9141e3be2b04b7eed696928\nChange-Id: I0dd32765755732a7a9141e3be2b04b7eed696928", "changed_files": [{"type": "modify", "old_path": "packages/SystemUI/src/com/android/systemui/ActivityIntentHelper.java", "new_path": "packages/SystemUI/src/com/android/systemui/ActivityIntentHelper.java"}, {"type": "modify", "old_path": "packages/SystemUI/src/com/android/systemui/statusbar/phone/CentralSurfacesImpl.java", "new_path": "packages/SystemUI/src/com/android/systemui/statusbar/phone/CentralSurfacesImpl.java"}, {"type": "modify", "old_path": "packages/SystemUI/src/com/android/systemui/statusbar/phone/StatusBarNotificationActivityStarter.java", "new_path": "packages/SystemUI/src/com/android/systemui/statusbar/phone/StatusBarNotificationActivityStarter.java"}, {"type": "modify", "old_path": "packages/SystemUI/src/com/android/systemui/statusbar/phone/StatusBarRemoteInputCallback.java", "new_path": "packages/SystemUI/src/com/android/systemui/statusbar/phone/StatusBarRemoteInputCallback.java"}, {"type": "modify", "old_path": "packages/SystemUI/tests/src/com/android/systemui/statusbar/phone/StatusBarNotificationActivityStarterTest.java", "new_path": "packages/SystemUI/tests/src/com/android/systemui/statusbar/phone/StatusBarNotificationActivityStarterTest.java"}]}